SleelaUI(TM) — original User Interface toolkit
==============================================

SleelaUI(TM) is an ORIGINAL cross-platform widget toolkit authored by the SLeeLa
project. The code in this directory (user-interface/) is clean-room work: it was
written from scratch by SLeeLa, guided by public window-system and font
*specifications* and the *ideas* common to modern UI toolkits, not by copying
any existing toolkit's source code.

